;; Proof receipt of absolute-zero (PROOF-POLICY §8.5.1, profile
;; proof-receipt). It describes source commit 8a3162a and the agda job of the
;; proofs.yml run on that commit. Every :pwg is the value the reader derives
;; from the legs and receipts (standards 1-formats/deed/tools/deed_lint.js
;; --proof-receipt-json). The rows, their statements and their scope are in
;; PROOF-STATUS.adoc, "Ledger (PWG receipt rows)".
;;
;; Every claim is PWG-3: the Agda leg is checked under the §2.1 invocation and
;; no recheck leg exists. The Rocq and Lean legs are unavailable, not waived.
;;
;; Import cone: agda --dependency-graph over the four CI roots gives 128
;; modules: the 4 roots (no other module of this repository), 115 modules of
;; agda-stdlib v1.7.3 and 9 modules supplied with Agda 2.6.3. The home
;; manifest also lists absolute-zero.agda-lib and the script that holds the
;; stdlib pin. The stdlib import lists the 115 modules and the library file.
;; The provisioning script renames that library file's name: line in the
;; checkout to "standard-library"; the manifest records the upstream blob.
;; A comment-aware postulate scan of all 128 modules finds only the four
;; Agda.Primitive postulates listed in (trusted-base); --safe refuses others.
;; The EchoBridge rows EB-3 and EB-4 take function extensionality as an
;; explicit argument of the theorem, not as a postulate, so (axioms) is empty.
